function normalizeShipRecord(record,key,legacy){const upgrades={...DEFAULT.upgrades,...(record?.upgrades||(legacy?.upgrades||{}))},capacity=SHIPS[key].fuel+upgrades.tank*SHIPS[key].tankStep,condition=Number.isFinite(record?.condition)?record.condition:Number.isFinite(legacy?.condition)?legacy.condition:100,fuel=Number.isFinite(record?.fuel)?record.fuel:Number.isFinite(legacy?.fuel)?legacy.fuel:SHIPS[key].fuel;return{condition:Math.max(0,Math.min(100,condition)),fuel:Math.max(0,Math.min(fuel,capacity)),upgrades}}
function load(){try{const x=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem("cosmicCargoSave")||"{}"),active=SHIPS[x.activeShip]?x.activeShip:'courier',legacyTraded=Array.isArray(x.retiredShips)?x.retiredShips:[],owned=[...new Set([...(Array.isArray(x.ownedShips)?x.ownedShips:[]),active])].filter(k=>SHIPS[k]),tradedShips=[...new Set([...(Array.isArray(x.tradedShips)?x.tradedShips:[]),...legacyTraded])].filter(k=>SHIPS[k]&&!owned.includes(k)),shipData={};owned.forEach(k=>shipData[k]=normalizeShipRecord(x.shipData?.[k],k,k===active?x:null));const activeData=shipData[active]||normalizeShipRecord(null,active,x),slotCount=SHIPS[active].slots,compatible=x.cargoLayoutVersion===2&&Array.isArray(x.slots)&&x.slots.length===slotCount;return{...structuredClone(DEFAULT),...x,ownedShips:owned.length?owned:['courier'],retiredShips:[],tradedShips,shipData,activeShip:active,condition:activeData.condition,fuel:activeData.fuel,upgrades:activeData.upgrades,slots:compatible?x.slots:Array(slotCount).fill(null),cargoRotations:compatible&&x.cargoRotations?x.cargoRotations:{},cargoLayoutVersion:2}}catch{const fresh=structuredClone(DEFAULT);fresh.shipData.courier=normalizeShipRecord(null,'courier',fresh);return fresh}}
